### SecureMeet API Tests
### Install "REST Client" VS Code extension to run these

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api
@token = PASTE_YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

### Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

###

### Register User
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser",
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "role": "admin"
}

###

### Login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

###

### Get Current User
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Create Meeting
POST {{baseUrl}}/meetings/create
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Team Standup"
}

###

### Test Toxic Message
POST {{baseUrl}}/moderation/predict
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "I hate you, you stupid idiot"
}

###

### Test Safe Message
POST {{baseUrl}}/moderation/predict
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Great meeting today everyone!"
}

###

### Get Stats
GET {{baseUrl}}/moderation/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Get Flagged Messages
GET {{baseUrl}}/moderation/flagged
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
